      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ……。\r\n劫火との命のやりとりで、\r\n俺は何かを掴んだ気がする。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. Battling him to the brink with my life on the line may have triggered something in me.",
        "real_en": "Yeah... I feel like I discovered something in that life-or-death fight with Inferno Veritas."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
