      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうか。\r\nニコル、ぜひ力を貸してくれ。",
        "official_en": "Oh yeah? Think you could ration out some of that brilliance, Nichol?",
        "real_en": "I see. Nichol, I'd really appreciate your help."
      },
