      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうかもな。\r\n前よりも自信をもって魔法を使える気がする。",
        "official_en": "You may be right. It feels as though I have greater control over it.",
        "real_en": "Maybe. I feel like I can use magic with more confidence than before."
