      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうだな。\r\n目が覚めてからやけに体が軽い気がする。\r\n常闇に回復してもらったせいだろうか……。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. My body feels unusually light compared to before. Is it because Umbra healed me, I wonder?",
        "real_en": "Indeed. My body feels unusually light compared to before. Is it because Veritas of the Dark healed me, I wonder?"
      },
